  ('ai:ai-batch-06:225a50d57a8b','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How does Tom go to school?',array['by car','on foot','by bike','by bus']::text[],'C','''Tom goes to school by bike.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Tom is twelve years old. He lives with his mother, his father and his little sister, Amy, in a small house in York. Tom''s father is a bus driver and his mother works in a shop. Tom goes to school by bike, but Amy walks with her mother. After school Tom plays football in the park. He doesn''t like computer games. In the evening the family eats dinner together at seven o''clock.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:35b0490494a8','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Tom do after school?',array['He plays computer games.','He works in a shop.','He walks with Amy.','He plays football.']::text[],'D','''After school Tom plays football in the park.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Tom is twelve years old. He lives with his mother, his father and his little sister, Amy, in a small house in York. Tom''s father is a bus driver and his mother works in a shop. Tom goes to school by bike, but Amy walks with her mother. After school Tom plays football in the park. He doesn''t like computer games. In the evening the family eats dinner together at seven o''clock.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:bc17f3882086','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When does the family have dinner?',array['at seven o''clock','at eight o''clock','at six o''clock','after football']::text[],'A','''The family eats dinner together at seven o''clock.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Tom is twelve years old. He lives with his mother, his father and his little sister, Amy, in a small house in York. Tom''s father is a bus driver and his mother works in a shop. Tom goes to school by bike, but Amy walks with her mother. After school Tom plays football in the park. He doesn''t like computer games. In the evening the family eats dinner together at seven o''clock.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:20da6616e89a','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When does the shop open on Sunday?',array['at 8 am','It is closed.','at 7 am','at 10 am']::text[],'D','''Sunday: 10 am to 4 pm.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Corner Shop — Opening times. Monday to Friday: 7 am to 9 pm. Saturday: 8 am to 9 pm. Sunday: 10 am to 4 pm. We sell bread, milk, fruit, newspapers and stamps. Sorry, we do not take cards for payments under £5.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f494dcbb3fc1','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','You want to buy milk for £2. How can you pay?',array['with a card','with stamps','You can''t buy it.','with cash']::text[],'D','Cards are not taken for payments under £5.',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Corner Shop — Opening times. Monday to Friday: 7 am to 9 pm. Saturday: 8 am to 9 pm. Sunday: 10 am to 4 pm. We sell bread, milk, fruit, newspapers and stamps. Sorry, we do not take cards for payments under £5.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f44a6ade3590','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which day does the shop open earliest?',array['Saturday','Sunday','Wednesday','All days are the same.']::text[],'C','Monday to Friday it opens at 7 am, the earliest time.',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Corner Shop — Opening times. Monday to Friday: 7 am to 9 pm. Saturday: 8 am to 9 pm. Sunday: 10 am to 4 pm. We sell bread, milk, fruit, newspapers and stamps. Sorry, we do not take cards for payments under £5.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:7d034859f02f','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where is Nina?',array['at home with Lena','in Mark''s house','in London','in Brighton']::text[],'D','''I''m in Brighton with my cousin Mark.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Lena, I''m in Brighton with my cousin Mark. The weather is sunny and warm. We go to the beach every morning. Mark can swim very well but I can''t, so I sit on the sand and read. Yesterday we ate fish and chips. Tomorrow we want to visit the pier. See you on Friday! Love, Nina',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:858f881c4cf5','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Nina do at the beach?',array['She reads.','She plays football.','She sells fish.','She swims.']::text[],'A','''I can''t [swim], so I sit on the sand and read.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Lena, I''m in Brighton with my cousin Mark. The weather is sunny and warm. We go to the beach every morning. Mark can swim very well but I can''t, so I sit on the sand and read. Yesterday we ate fish and chips. Tomorrow we want to visit the pier. See you on Friday! Love, Nina',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:48a1ecc39752','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did Nina and Mark eat yesterday?',array['ice cream','pizza','sandwiches','fish and chips']::text[],'D','''Yesterday we ate fish and chips.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Lena, I''m in Brighton with my cousin Mark. The weather is sunny and warm. We go to the beach every morning. Mark can swim very well but I can''t, so I sit on the sand and read. Yesterday we ate fish and chips. Tomorrow we want to visit the pier. See you on Friday! Love, Nina',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:aa20fb60bfca','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What do they want to do tomorrow?',array['go swimming','visit the pier','visit Lena','go home']::text[],'B','''Tomorrow we want to visit the pier.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Lena, I''m in Brighton with my cousin Mark. The weather is sunny and warm. We go to the beach every morning. Mark can swim very well but I can''t, so I sit on the sand and read. Yesterday we ate fish and chips. Tomorrow we want to visit the pier. See you on Friday! Love, Nina',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:ac449c7336b3','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where is the guitar?',array['next to the bed','under the desk','on the shelves','behind the door']::text[],'D','''My guitar is behind the door.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','My bedroom is small but I love it. There is a bed next to the window and a big desk under the shelves. My books are on the shelves and my guitar is behind the door. The walls are blue. There isn''t a TV in my room, but there is a radio on the desk.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:ce60e4aa48e8','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What colour are the walls?',array['blue','white','green','yellow']::text[],'A','''The walls are blue.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','My bedroom is small but I love it. There is a bed next to the window and a big desk under the shelves. My books are on the shelves and my guitar is behind the door. The walls are blue. There isn''t a TV in my room, but there is a radio on the desk.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:fe623de1af18','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which is in the room?',array['a TV','a sofa','a computer','a radio']::text[],'D','''There isn''t a TV... but there is a radio on the desk.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','My bedroom is small but I love it. There is a bed next to the window and a big desk under the shelves. My books are on the shelves and my guitar is behind the door. The walls are blue. There isn''t a TV in my room, but there is a radio on the desk.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f2a8c958d44a','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What time does Ali get up?',array['7.30','6.15','6.30','7.15']::text[],'C','''Ali gets up at half past six.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Ali gets up at half past six. He has a shower and then he has breakfast: tea, bread and an egg. He catches the train at quarter past seven. He works in a hospital in Leeds. He finishes work at four o''clock. On Wednesdays he goes to an English class in the evening.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:14b6293d0f6a','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where does Ali work?',array['in a school','in a café','in a hospital','at a train station']::text[],'C','''He works in a hospital in Leeds.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Ali gets up at half past six. He has a shower and then he has breakfast: tea, bread and an egg. He catches the train at quarter past seven. He works in a hospital in Leeds. He finishes work at four o''clock. On Wednesdays he goes to an English class in the evening.',null,null,null,'exam'),
