  ('ai:ai-batch-06:1b6536cdd776','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where does Tom live?',array['in Brighton','in Leeds','in London','in York']::text[],'D','''...in a small house in York.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Tom is twelve years old. He lives with his mother, his father and his little sister, Amy, in a small house in York. Tom''s father is a bus driver and his mother works in a shop. Tom goes to school by bike, but Amy walks with her mother. After school Tom plays football in the park. He doesn''t like computer games. In the evening the family eats dinner together at seven o''clock.',null,null,null,'exam'),
