  ('ai:ai-batch-06:d88c99430457','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did Hannah leave her office job?',array['The pay was too low.','She moved to Bristol.','She was bored.','She was ill.']::text[],'C','''She was bored because she sat at a computer all day.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hannah started a new job last month at a garden centre near Bristol. Before that, she worked in an office for six years, but she was bored because she sat at a computer all day. Now she spends most of the day outside, helping customers to choose plants. The pay is lower than in her old job, so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money. She says she feels healthier and much happier. Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:1383aec9b9c5','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How long did Hannah work in an office?',array['one month','six years','one year','sixteen years']::text[],'B','''She worked in an office for six years.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hannah started a new job last month at a garden centre near Bristol. Before that, she worked in an office for six years, but she was bored because she sat at a computer all day. Now she spends most of the day outside, helping customers to choose plants. The pay is lower than in her old job, so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money. She says she feels healthier and much happier. Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:160926fc9d4c','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why does Hannah cycle to work now?',array['because it is faster','because she has no car','because the garden centre asks her to','to save money']::text[],'D','''The pay is lower... so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hannah started a new job last month at a garden centre near Bristol. Before that, she worked in an office for six years, but she was bored because she sat at a computer all day. Now she spends most of the day outside, helping customers to choose plants. The pay is lower than in her old job, so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money. She says she feels healthier and much happier. Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:a8d743512629','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is Hannah going to do next spring?',array['start a course','change her job again','move to Bristol','buy a car']::text[],'A','''Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hannah started a new job last month at a garden centre near Bristol. Before that, she worked in an office for six years, but she was bored because she sat at a computer all day. Now she spends most of the day outside, helping customers to choose plants. The pay is lower than in her old job, so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money. She says she feels healthier and much happier. Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:8b53ff355e26','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which sentence is true about Hannah''s new job?',array['She works inside all day.','She doesn''t like it.','It pays less than her old job.','She works at a computer.']::text[],'C','''The pay is lower than in her old job.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hannah started a new job last month at a garden centre near Bristol. Before that, she worked in an office for six years, but she was bored because she sat at a computer all day. Now she spends most of the day outside, helping customers to choose plants. The pay is lower than in her old job, so she cycles to work instead of driving to save money. She says she feels healthier and much happier. Next spring she is going to start a course in garden design.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:842299b7b31b','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did the family sleep in the car on the first night?',array['The sheep were noisy.','They couldn''t find a campsite.','Water came into the tent.','It was too cold.']::text[],'C','''It rained so much that water came into our tent.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Last summer my family went camping in the Lake District for a week. On the first night it rained so much that water came into our tent, and we had to sleep in the car. The next day the sun came out and we climbed a hill called Catbells. It wasn''t very high, but the views were wonderful. My little brother was scared of the sheep at first, but by the end of the week he was feeding them. We''re planning to go back next year, but this time we''re going to stay in a cottage.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:ee9b48a6a24c','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the writer say about Catbells?',array['They couldn''t see anything.','It wasn''t very high but the views were wonderful.','It was very high and difficult.','It was too high to climb.']::text[],'B','''It wasn''t very high, but the views were wonderful.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Last summer my family went camping in the Lake District for a week. On the first night it rained so much that water came into our tent, and we had to sleep in the car. The next day the sun came out and we climbed a hill called Catbells. It wasn''t very high, but the views were wonderful. My little brother was scared of the sheep at first, but by the end of the week he was feeding them. We''re planning to go back next year, but this time we''re going to stay in a cottage.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:c76ad508fac0','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the brother feel about the sheep at the end of the week?',array['He didn''t see them again.','He was still scared.','He was angry with them.','He wasn''t afraid any more.']::text[],'D','''By the end of the week he was feeding them.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Last summer my family went camping in the Lake District for a week. On the first night it rained so much that water came into our tent, and we had to sleep in the car. The next day the sun came out and we climbed a hill called Catbells. It wasn''t very high, but the views were wonderful. My little brother was scared of the sheep at first, but by the end of the week he was feeding them. We''re planning to go back next year, but this time we''re going to stay in a cottage.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:282b16a4275c','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What will be different next year?',array['They will go somewhere else.','They won''t climb hills.','They will camp for two weeks.','They will stay in a cottage.']::text[],'D','''This time we''re going to stay in a cottage.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Last summer my family went camping in the Lake District for a week. On the first night it rained so much that water came into our tent, and we had to sleep in the car. The next day the sun came out and we climbed a hill called Catbells. It wasn''t very high, but the views were wonderful. My little brother was scared of the sheep at first, but by the end of the week he was feeding them. We''re planning to go back next year, but this time we''re going to stay in a cottage.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:b9b2ad738843','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much do you pay each month, not including bills?',array['£800','£850 including bills','£850','£85']::text[],'C','''Rent: £850 a month, plus bills.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','FLAT TO RENT — Two bedrooms, first floor, five minutes'' walk from the station. Fully furnished, with a new kitchen. Rent: £850 a month, plus bills. No pets. Available from 1st March. Students welcome. To arrange a visit, email Mr Patel (no phone calls after 8 pm).',null,null,null,'exam'),
