  ('ai:ai-batch-06:1513fecd230e','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How should you contact Mr Patel to visit the flat?',array['in person at the station','by letter','by phone at any time','by email']::text[],'D','''To arrange a visit, email Mr Patel.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','FLAT TO RENT — Two bedrooms, first floor, five minutes'' walk from the station. Fully furnished, with a new kitchen. Rent: £850 a month, plus bills. No pets. Available from 1st March. Students welcome. To arrange a visit, email Mr Patel (no phone calls after 8 pm).',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:9e3cfc4e200a','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which group is best for a new runner?',array['the Tuesday group','either group, they are the same','neither — beginners can''t join','the Thursday group']::text[],'A','''Beginners are welcome: on Tuesdays there is a slower group that runs 3 km.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Riverside Running Club meets every Tuesday and Thursday at 6.30 pm outside the sports centre. Beginners are welcome: on Tuesdays there is a slower group that runs 3 km. On Thursdays we run 8 km along the river. The first two sessions are free; after that membership costs £20 a year. Wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water. We don''t run if there is ice on the paths.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:5b7c6e89d939','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much does it cost to try the club twice?',array['£10','£20','nothing','£2']::text[],'C','''The first two sessions are free.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Riverside Running Club meets every Tuesday and Thursday at 6.30 pm outside the sports centre. Beginners are welcome: on Tuesdays there is a slower group that runs 3 km. On Thursdays we run 8 km along the river. The first two sessions are free; after that membership costs £20 a year. Wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water. We don''t run if there is ice on the paths.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:df36f5c0eb92','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When does the club NOT run?',array['on Thursdays in winter','when fewer than ten people come','when it rains','when the paths are icy']::text[],'D','''We don''t run if there is ice on the paths.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Riverside Running Club meets every Tuesday and Thursday at 6.30 pm outside the sports centre. Beginners are welcome: on Tuesdays there is a slower group that runs 3 km. On Thursdays we run 8 km along the river. The first two sessions are free; after that membership costs £20 a year. Wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water. We don''t run if there is ice on the paths.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:9d68cfbc4c59','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How far is the Thursday run?',array['3 km','20 km','6.5 km','8 km']::text[],'D','''On Thursdays we run 8 km along the river.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Riverside Running Club meets every Tuesday and Thursday at 6.30 pm outside the sports centre. Beginners are welcome: on Tuesdays there is a slower group that runs 3 km. On Thursdays we run 8 km along the river. The first two sessions are free; after that membership costs £20 a year. Wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water. We don''t run if there is ice on the paths.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f24805123043','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why can''t Kate go to the cinema tonight?',array['She has no ticket.','She is ill.','She has to work late.','She is meeting her boss.']::text[],'C','''My boss asked me to stay late because a colleague is ill.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Dan, sorry, I can''t meet you at the cinema tonight. My boss asked me to stay late because a colleague is ill. Could we go on Saturday afternoon instead? The film is on at 2.15 and 5.30. I''ve already bought my ticket for tonight, but the cinema says I can change it for free. Let me know which time is better for you. Kate',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:522b742b9847','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Kate want Dan to do?',array['choose a time on Saturday','call her boss','buy a new ticket','go to the cinema without her']::text[],'A','''Let me know which time is better for you.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Dan, sorry, I can''t meet you at the cinema tonight. My boss asked me to stay late because a colleague is ill. Could we go on Saturday afternoon instead? The film is on at 2.15 and 5.30. I''ve already bought my ticket for tonight, but the cinema says I can change it for free. Let me know which time is better for you. Kate',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:bec4df6991bd','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Kate say about her ticket?',array['She hasn''t bought one yet.','She can change it without paying.','She must pay to change it.','She has lost it.']::text[],'B','''The cinema says I can change it for free.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Dan, sorry, I can''t meet you at the cinema tonight. My boss asked me to stay late because a colleague is ill. Could we go on Saturday afternoon instead? The film is on at 2.15 and 5.30. I''ve already bought my ticket for tonight, but the cinema says I can change it for free. Let me know which time is better for you. Kate',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f9c465dabbbb','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Who is ill?',array['one of Kate''s colleagues','Kate''s boss','Kate','Dan']::text[],'A','''...a colleague is ill.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','Hi Dan, sorry, I can''t meet you at the cinema tonight. My boss asked me to stay late because a colleague is ill. Could we go on Saturday afternoon instead? The film is on at 2.15 and 5.30. I''ve already bought my ticket for tonight, but the cinema says I can change it for free. Let me know which time is better for you. Kate',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:5fb7a7780cd4','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What must you pay for at the Science Museum?',array['entry to the museum','some special exhibitions','the picnic area','everything after 6 pm']::text[],'B','''Free to enter, but some special exhibitions cost money.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','The Science Museum in London is free to enter, but some special exhibitions cost money. It is open every day from 10 am to 6 pm, and on the last Wednesday of each month it stays open until 10 pm for adults only. The museum café on the ground floor is often busy at lunchtime, so visitors can also eat their own food in the picnic area in the basement.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:f609eba4e1c2','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When can adults visit the museum until 10 pm?',array['every Wednesday','at weekends','on the last Wednesday of the month','every day']::text[],'C','''On the last Wednesday of each month it stays open until 10 pm for adults only.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','The Science Museum in London is free to enter, but some special exhibitions cost money. It is open every day from 10 am to 6 pm, and on the last Wednesday of each month it stays open until 10 pm for adults only. The museum café on the ground floor is often busy at lunchtime, so visitors can also eat their own food in the picnic area in the basement.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:734b51176661','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where can visitors eat their own sandwiches?',array['on the ground floor','in the basement','in the café','outside only']::text[],'B','''...eat their own food in the picnic area in the basement.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','The Science Museum in London is free to enter, but some special exhibitions cost money. It is open every day from 10 am to 6 pm, and on the last Wednesday of each month it stays open until 10 pm for adults only. The museum café on the ground floor is often busy at lunchtime, so visitors can also eat their own food in the picnic area in the basement.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:aa6060e30206','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why might visitors not want to use the café at lunchtime?',array['It is only for adults.','It is expensive.','It is closed.','It is often busy.']::text[],'D','''The museum café... is often busy at lunchtime.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','The Science Museum in London is free to enter, but some special exhibitions cost money. It is open every day from 10 am to 6 pm, and on the last Wednesday of each month it stays open until 10 pm for adults only. The museum café on the ground floor is often busy at lunchtime, so visitors can also eat their own food in the picnic area in the basement.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:894736ab68e4','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where did the writer''s family spend every August?',array['on a farm in Wales','in Spain','at home','by the sea in Scotland']::text[],'A','''Every August we drove to my grandparents'' farm in Wales.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','When I was a child, we never went abroad on holiday. Every August we drove to my grandparents'' farm in Wales. My grandfather got up at five to milk the cows, and I sometimes helped him. In the evenings there was no television, so we played cards or listened to my grandmother''s stories. At the time I wanted to go to Spain like my friends, but now those are my happiest memories.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:c65b3a1b70f6','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did they do in the evenings?',array['went to Spain','milked the cows','watched television','played cards or listened to stories']::text[],'D','''There was no television, so we played cards or listened to my grandmother''s stories.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','When I was a child, we never went abroad on holiday. Every August we drove to my grandparents'' farm in Wales. My grandfather got up at five to milk the cows, and I sometimes helped him. In the evenings there was no television, so we played cards or listened to my grandmother''s stories. At the time I wanted to go to Spain like my friends, but now those are my happiest memories.',null,null,null,'exam'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-06:3c174fdc7598','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the writer feel about the holidays as a child?',array['They wanted to go to Spain instead.','They didn''t like their grandparents.','They were scared of the cows.','They loved them more than anything.']::text[],'A','''At the time I wanted to go to Spain like my friends.''',array['exam','reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-06','When I was a child, we never went abroad on holiday. Every August we drove to my grandparents'' farm in Wales. My grandfather got up at five to milk the cows, and I sometimes helped him. In the evenings there was no television, so we played cards or listened to my grandmother''s stories. At the time I wanted to go to Spain like my friends, but now those are my happiest memories.',null,null,null,'exam'),
